# Tracked empty stub. docker-compose.yml bind-mounts this as /home/dev/.ssh/authorized_keys
# when BILLET_AUTHORIZED_KEYS is unset, so a build on a machine without the VM's
# authorized_keys never hard-fails. sshd trusts no keys in that case. Under billet the
# variable is never unset: `billet start` exports it (the Host admin user's
# ~/.ssh/authorized_keys) before every compose call, so this stub only ever applies to a
# build away from the VM.
